<title>USA: TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $1.25 million Evert Cup women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seedings):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>10-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Francesca Lubiani (Italy)</p>
<p>6-7 (8-10) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>11-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 5-7 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Mana Endo (Japan) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Silvia Farina (Italy)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Tami Whitlinger-Jones (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-0</p>
<p>6-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Alexia Dechaume-Balleret</p>
<p>(France) 6-7 (3-7) 7-6 (9-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Florencia Labat (Argentina) beat 8-Amanda Coetzer (South</p>
<p>Africa) 1-6 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>9-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>12-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Olga Barabanschikova</p>
<p>(Belarus) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>13-Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Helena Sukova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Sadrine Testud (France) beat 16-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 5-7 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
